# The repo-wide `*.pem` ignore (packages/android/.gitignore) would drop these,
# but the two Let's Encrypt ISRG root certificates are bundled into the APK as
# TLS trust anchors for Android 7.0 (see ../xml/network_security_config.xml),
# so they MUST be committed. Re-include them here.
!isrg_root_x1.pem
!isrg_root_x2.pem
